### fflate 0.8.3 — MIT

A dependency of `@tk-reawakened/core`, which imports only the `fflate/browser` subpath and only its synchronous APIs (AD-6). It decompresses the zlib/deflate streams inside PNG image data (`decodeTexture`, format-spec §10) and, in the package reader, inside `.tpk`/ZIP archives (format-spec §13).

