### TK-16 authored General MIDI banks — CC0-1.0

The project ships three compact, Super NES-flavoured General MIDI banks in
`media/soundfonts/`. They are authored entirely from deterministic mathematical
waveforms and contain no third-party or recorded samples. Each carries 16
melodic timbres mapped over GM programs 0–127 and a synthesised kit on
percussion keys 35–81. Every sample is listed individually in
`tools/licences/tk16-provenance.json`, including its generator, root key, rate,
loop range and CC0-1.0 provenance.

| File | Style | Bytes | SHA-256 |
|---|---|---:|---|
| `TK-16.sf2` (default) | Classic RPG | 563,992 | `a79fa6d4ae3b8ab8b3f3e3ddd4ab3d59a0ac24222caffcdd914435d76872ede2` |
| `TK-16-Whimsical.sf2` | Whimsical | 585,394 | `5f2d864ec3490055e22a0df8737ac659246b86db0a8865c0f72bfb90064e8b44` |
| `TK-16-Arcade.sf2` | Arcade | 625,298 | `c4dbde2c10932d4621bc283960c5b7864b3b3523765d0e126656c81249403ed6` |

The owner chose Classic RPG as the default on 2026-11-01; the other two are
selectable bundled banks.

TK-16 is an authored General MIDI bank built entirely from deterministic mathematical waveforms; it contains no third-party samples.

